hpc:Queue a owl:Class .
hpc:Queue rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .
hpc:QueueName rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Priority rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .
hpc:Nice rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .
hpc:ApsPriority rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
hpc:QueueGroup rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Description rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:apsPriorityValue a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
hpc:apsPriorityWeights a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:ApsPriorityValue .

hpc:ApsPriorityWeights rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
hpc:WORK rdf:datatype xsd:decimal .
hpc:JOB_PRIORITY rdf:datatype xsd:decimal .
hpc:QUEUE_PRIORITY rdf:datatype xsd:decimal .

hpc:fairshare a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Queue ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Usershares .
hpc:UserShares a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines the `hpc:Queue` class and its properties, including `hpc:QUEUE_NAME`, `hpc:PRIORITY`, `hpc:NICE`, `hpc:APS_PRIORITY`, `hpc:QUEUE_GROUP`, and `hpc:DESCRIPTION`. It also defines the `hpc:APS_PRIORITY_VALUE` object property, which has a datatype property `hpc:APS_PRIORITY_WEIGHTS`. The datatype properties `hpc:WORK`, `hpc:JOB_PRIORITY`, and `hpc:QUEUE_PRIORITY` are defined as decimal types. The `hpc:FAIRSHARE` object property is defined to have the domain `hpc:Queue` and range `hpc:UserShares`. The `hpc:UserShares` class is also defined.
